    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, who has taken a job as a special cleaner, goes to his first cleaning site with his seniors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witnessing the scene of a gruesome death, he begins to feel something that he has never felt before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He begins to feel the presence of something he has never felt before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of short stories in 3 parts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 endings + several extra endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard and mouse controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation Method</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAB key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137220/extras/09b117a16d5e24b90dc632ccb4c8f0db.avif?t=1740138212\" data-has-big width=800 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137220/extras/c543fa199f5a3a6d7b853e174d88db03.avif?t=1740138212\" data-has-big width=800 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137220/extras/89b71bc363f15804ce19578f49d3b218.avif?t=1740138212\" data-has-big width=800 height=408 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains elements of a walking simulator in which you move around the map while checking items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" 